# Build context of the docs image (docker-compose builds it from the repository root).
# Keeps secrets and host build output out of the context: a host node_modules copied over the image's
# would also replace platform-specific binaries.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
postgres_data
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.docusaurus
docs/docs/api
backend
frontend
